Reading: two of five items done at start; ticking and unticking update the counter (`aria-label` "n of 5 done") and the status line; a cell click selects it and the formula bar shows its value, the arrow keys move the selection (D4 shows `=B4*C4`); dragging the table by its title moves it 1:1 (+120, −40 screen px at zoom 1) and leaves the selection unchanged (no click after a drag); a press on a checklist label that moves never drags the block; German shows `=SUMME(D2:D5)`, the sum is 197.50 = 76.00 + 45.50 + 50.00 + 26.00; at 390×844 no horizontal overflow and note A, checklist, zone, table and note B stack without overlap.

